Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; GitHub repository (Reed Waller): https://github.com/sn1perm4n/scripts/tree/main/registry_files
; Disables the User Account Profile Picture in Windows (especially useful for unactivated Windows installs)

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Policies\Explorer]
"UseDefaultTile"=dword:00000001